			"notes": "Fabric builds for Minecraft **26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3**. Download the JAR matching your instance.\n\n- Add a real Minecraft 26.3 build with current SDL input types and distinct keyboard/mouse bindings.\n- Build and bundle the official MoulConfig 26.3 source at a pinned, checksum-verified revision, with its access widener and corrected mouse binding encoding.\n- Preserve existing Minecraft Controls bindings by stable key names.\n- Build and publish all supported targets on GitHub-hosted runners.\n\nRequires Java 25, Fabric API, and Fabric Language Kotlin. MoulConfig is bundled.\n\nValidation: all three jars built, production mixins transformed through Fabric, and actual offline world tests passed for peek-chat rendering, 120-message retention, trimming to 100, keyboard/mouse binding round trips, and the bundled config/dashboard screen. Hypixel gameplay was not exercised.\n\nThe integration test JVM uses four active processors. On this Windows host, unrestricted native startup also crashed in the Fabric baseline with this mod and MoulConfig disabled; the reduced-processor tests exited cleanly. User launcher settings are unchanged."
		},
